On 6/5/07, turnip <turnip@bcpl.net> wrote:
>
> mu'i ma do ne'i zutse lo tanxe (bunny sitting in box)
> xu do ca'o ne'i sanli leva tanxe (bunny stading in box)

I think you want {zutse ne'i lo tanxe}/{sanli ne'i le va tanxe}
for those.

{ne'i zutse/sanli lo tanxe} says that the bunny is sitting/standing
on the box, and that this happens inside of something unspecified
(a room?).

{zutse/sanli ne'i lo tanxe} says that the bunny is sitting/standing
on something unspecified (the floor of the box?), and that this
happens inside the box.

